# Riverfork Delta's otter sea cave (CIPlay riverfork_delta_caves, 11-08; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its
# recipe: the mouth on the sea floor at 116 30 (some 10 m down) off the east beach below the crane's mountain, the
# boulder cairn on the beach at 76 37, the flooded tunnel climbing west under the spit to the dry den round 48 30 (air
# zone rd_den, the seed tin). Swim in from the sea floor up the tunnel (no teleport into the den), breathe there, take
# the seeds, swim back out to the sea.
island Riverfork Delta keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

# Outside: the cairn on the beach and the spit, the mouth on the sea floor
picture rd_cave_out 92 4 46 76 0 36
picture rd_spit 100 8 14 80 1 30
picture rd_cave_mouth 122 -6 24 116 -9 30

# Swim in: from the sea floor before the mouth up the flooded tunnel into the den, and breathe there
walk 120 30 to 116 30 to 100 30 to 80 30 to 62 30 to 48 30 below=-3
air rd_den here

# The den: dry, air, the seed tin
picture rd_den_in 55 4 30 46 3 31
picture rd_den_out 44 4 30 60 2 30
picture rd_tunnel 76 -1 30 62 1 30
open Seed tin
wait 2
expect item Seed_Mango 2
expect item Seed_Pineapple 2
air rd_den

# Back out: down the tunnel and out of the mouth onto the sea floor
walk 48 30 to 62 30 to 80 30 to 100 30 to 116 30 to 120 30 below=7
